    "text": "The number of elements in the set <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>:</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, where <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Z</mi></math> is the set of all integers, is"
  },
