  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>49</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>±</mo><mn>7</mn></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mn>6</mn></math> do not give integer value of <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></math> .<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>±</mo><mn>5</mn></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>⇒</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>±</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />Similarly,<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>±</mo><mn>7</mn></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>⇒</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>±</mo><mn>5</mn></math><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>±</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>⇒</mo></math> The required number of elements <math><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn></math>"
